cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this repository as a software research archive. The attribution below
  identifies the publishing GitHub account, not a confirmed manuscript author
  list. No journal publication, DOI, clinical validation or expert gold standard
  is asserted. Please record the exact commit used in a reproduction.
type: software
title: OHDSI Evidence Agent
authors:
  - name: raywong2121
repository-code: https://github.com/raywong2121/agentsforEHR
url: https://github.com/raywong2121/agentsforEHR
abstract: >-
  Dify-native research workflow for evidence-aware association of Chinese
  clinical free text with OHDSI concepts, including Code-owned task dispatch,
  scoped vocabulary retrieval, binding review and offline engineering controls.
  Research evidence cutoff is 2026-10-25. Contract checks are not clinical
  validation, and cross-case autonomous learning has not been established.
keywords:
  - OHDSI
  - clinical natural language processing
  - concept association
  - Dify
  - evidence-aware agents
